flowchart LR
  Register[Register project] --> Detect[Detect framework]
  Detect --> Resolve[Resolve runtimes]
  Resolve --> Plan[Plan setup dry-run]
  Plan --> Apply[Apply with journal]
  Apply --> Domain[Add domain]
  Domain --> Cert[Issue cert via local CA]
  Cert --> Render[Render web config]
  Render --> Validate[Validate nginx-t httpd-t caddy-validate]
  Validate -->|fail| Rollback[Rollback + keep old]
  Validate -->|pass| Reload[Backup + reload + health]
  Reload --> DNS[DNS + hosts + NRPT]
  DNS --> SVC[Start services + workers + scheduler]
  SVC --> Health[Health chain DNS-TCP-TLS-HTTP]
